[[Higgans]] advised that the [[Huntik Foundation]] use their Scramjets to transport the [[Huntik Foundation]] and [[Casterwill family]] to the location of the [[Spiral Mark]]. After [[Zhalia Moon]] informed [[Dante Vale]] of the location, four Scramjets headed to the [[Siberia|Siberian Plateau]]. {{source|Words from Eathon}}

The four jets headed to the Spiral Mark, one piloted by [[Metz]] and [[Lady S.]], one piloted by [[LeBlanche]] and [[Santiago]], one piloted by [[Teien]] and [[Focauld Casterwill]] and another piloted by [[Scarlet Byrne]] who was joined by [[Sandra Lambert]], who had a stowed away using [[Camoforge]]. However, as the Scramjets arrived in the territory of [[the Betrayer]], he jammed the radios, planning for them to be in the blast radius of the [[Red Comet]] which had changed course and begun heading towards the Earth. Dante managed to stop the impact, albeit at the cost of his own life. {{source|The Spiral Mark}}

[[Lok Lambert]] managed to contact all the Scramjets and lead them into a full-on attack on the [[Blood Spiral Base]]. All Power Amplifiers were used and a large battle ensued with [[Bazela's Insect]] carrying [[Silent Soldiers]] into the sky to attack the jets. {{Source|Lok and the Betrayer}}

[[Wind]] and [[Shakrit]] destroyed one of the Scramjets, with Santiago rescuing LeBlanche in the nick of time. Momax's jet was also heavily damaged by the pair, but [[Montehue]] arrived in time for them to both use [[Mjolnir]] to defeat the pair. {{source|Dante's Return}}
